    "compose_patient": {
      "sections": [
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.0",
          "heading": "why_in_hospital",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.0",
            "sections.1"
          ],
          "text": "You came in with chest pain and shortness of breath on exertion.\n\nThe team found you had:\n- A heart attack (NSTEMI)\n- Severe narrowing in three of the arteries supplying your heart\n\nThe team looked at whether a procedure to open the arteries (PCI) was possible. After a team discussion, they decided it was not suitable for you. Your heart is being treated with medicines instead."
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.1",
          "heading": "what_we_did",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.2",
            "sections.3"
          ],
          "text": "Tests you had:\n- A heart tracing (ECG)\n- Blood tests, including a heart muscle protein (troponin)\n- A camera test of the heart's arteries (coronary angiogram)\n\nTreatment in hospital:\n- A blood-thinning medicine (fondaparinux) was started\n- A medicine to prevent blood clots (ticagrelor) was added\n- A heart medicine (bisoprolol) was increased in dose\n- A medicine for chest pain (isosorbide mononitrate) was added\n- You worked with physiotherapy to help you move around"
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.2",
          "heading": "medicines",
          "source_ids": [],
          "text": "{{MEDICATIONS}}"
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.3",
          "heading": "next_steps",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.7",
            "sections.8"
          ],
          "text": "- You have a cardiology outpatient appointment in 6 weeks.\n- A referral to cardiac rehabilitation has been completed.\n- Your GP will check your kidney blood tests.\n- Your GP will monitor your kidney function and adjust a blood pressure medicine as tolerated."
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.4",
          "heading": "safety_net",
          "source_ids": [],
          "text": "{{SAFETY_NET}}"
        }
